  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC087">
          <l>mutaṟciṉaik kiḷavik katuveṉ vēṟṟumai</l>
          <l>mutaṟkaṇ varinē ciṉaikkai varumē.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/69/mode/1up">69</ref>.</p>
      <p>
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n93/mode/1up">90</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. mutaṟcollōṭu toṭarnta ciṉaiccolliṟku, āṟāmvēṟṟumai mutaṟkaṇ varumāyiṉ, ciṉaiccolliṉkaṇ iraṇṭāmvēṟṟumaiyē varum. e-ṟu.</p>
      <p>u-m.</p> 
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Cena-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Cena-cit2">
        <l>"ciṉainilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum"</l>
        <p>eṉṟataṉāṉ mutaṟciṉaikkiḷavikkum iraṇṭuvēṟṟumaiyumeytuvataṉai niyamittavāṟu. itu varuñcūttirattiṟkumokkum.</p>
      </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
